{"sourceUrl":"https://soa.csu.edu.cn/info/1032/9784.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.679860+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://soa.csu.edu.cn/info/1032/9784.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>推荐优秀应届本科毕业</span></span><span>生</span><span><span>免试攻读研究生</span></span><span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“推免”）</span></span><span><span>考核录取</span></span><span>有关工作要求</span><span><span>，经学院</span></span><span>研究生</span><span><span>招生工作领导小组研究决定，制订我院</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>推免考核录取工作实施细则</span><span><span>如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、工作原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>坚持科学、规范、公平、公开的原则</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>严格规范管理，</span><span><span>严守工作纪律，切实做好</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>推免招生</span><span><span>各项工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、组织管理</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）</span><span><span>学院</span></span><span>研究生招生工作领导小组</span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span>易险峰、王雅琳</span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span>黄科科</span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span>梁步阁、陈晓方、徐德刚、张巧丽、谭小钰、</span><span>连选</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）学院研究生招生思想政治素质和品德考核小组</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span>易险峰</span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span>学院研究生招生工作领导小组、</span><span>刘雯</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立学科专业</span></span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>小组，具体实施</span></span><span>申请材料审核及</span><span><span>学科专业</span></span><span>面试考核</span><span><span>工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（四）</span><span><span>学院研究生招生</span></span><span>考核</span><span><span>监督小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span>梁步阁</span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span>董密、陈宁、赵于前</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、招生</span></span><span>专业</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我院</span><span><span>招生专业</span></span><span>包括</span><span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（一）学术学位：</span><span><span>0811 </span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                                             <span>1405 </span><span>智能科学与技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（二）专业学位：</span><span><span>0854 </span><span>电子信息</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以学校</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免生招生专业目录为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、</span></span><span>申请条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）</span><span>遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律、诚实守信</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span><span>2027</span><span>届优秀本科毕业生，且有望取得所在学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（三）学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，具有较强的研究能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）具有良好的心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请时间：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>18</span><span>点</span></span><span><span>前，通过</span><span>“中南大学推免生服务系统”进行网上报名。报名网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span><span>资格审查</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>完成网上申请的学生于</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>18</span><span>点</span></span><span><span>前提交资格审查材料至电子邮箱</span></span><span><span>zidonghua</span></span><span>@csu.edu.cn<span>，邮件主题为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科学校名称</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>，所有材料按顺序整理成一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科学校名称</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>”</span><span>。提交资格审查的材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）本人身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）网上报名《申请表》一份（网上提交申请后下载打印，不需要加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（三）个人简历；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>四</span><span><span>）学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>五</span><span><span>）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单</span></span><span>等外语水平证明</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>六</span><span><span>）科研创新成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（七）获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（八）本人签名的诚信承诺书。</span><span><span>申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性</span></span><span>，若推免过程中存在弄虚作假情况，一经查实</span><span><span>，将取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六、材料审核</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>学院成立材料审核专家组，专家按照学校材料审核办法和工作要求，对推免生的申请材料进行审核并百分制打分，学院根据材料审核成绩择优筛选进入面试考核的考生名单</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>七</span><span>、面试考核</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我院</span><span><span>按照</span></span><span>推免考核工作</span><span><span>要求</span></span><span>组织面试，面试</span><span><span>过程全程录音录像。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span>面试</span><span><span>时间、地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span>时间：</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span><span>-17</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span>地点：中南大学岳麓山校区升华楼</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>二</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>面</span><span><span>试方式和内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）专业基础测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）综合素质及能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）外语能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>八</span><span>、</span><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span><span>与</span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.</span> <span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>各二级培养单位思想政治表现考核小组按照《关于博、硕士研究生指导教师认定和招生录取工作中加强思想政治把关的有关规定（试行）》要求。根据考生表现进行打分，考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，考核不合格不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>心理健康测试根据《中南大学硕士研究生复试心理测验工作的说明》组织和实施，考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>九</span><span><span>、录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>申请人取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿，我校将根据学校推免录取实际情况发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>十</span><span>、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>本通知内容与教育主管部门</span></span><span>及学校</span><span><span>日后下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门</span></span><span>及学校</span><span><span>下达的文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询、投诉受理电话：</span>0731-</span><span><span>88830342</span></span><span><span>，联系人：</span></span><span>谭</span><span><span>老师。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span><span>806577763</span><span>，（群名：</span><span>27</span><span>中南大学自动化学院研招宣传）</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学</span></span><span>自动化</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026年9月6日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"177f84aee51ff0b20d65817206311b3b98f608bba5da934c6e14d46e86b1314e","textLength":1727,"sourceSha256":"c194f549545c871e48c9cf1ecab7b9fb4c9bd8c44cfad9389f3c070901b869b8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"考生诚信考核承诺书.docx","url":"https://soa.csu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1523423077&wbfileid=18201860"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b7d91ada315eb6f85bab","title":"2026年中南大学自动化学院2027年推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生考核录取工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.679860+00:00"}
